{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geometry Arena</strong> is a free-form arena-shooter Roguelite with heavy emphasis on building an overpowered character. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 classes with unique mechanics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 color variations that bring ability changes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75 skill modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 difficulty options which allow you to DIY your game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 difficulty levels to suit the real needs of each player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ bullet variations and splits that stack up perfectly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >160+ upgrades that can be mixed and matched</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels of adjustable light effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and rewarding character development process</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limitless rune upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore character attribute system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous but destructible enemy projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense and exciting arena battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode with its leaderboard</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summarize  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety, Freedom, and Infinity\u00a0are the core pillars\u00a0of the\u00a0<i>Geometry Arena</i> series. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can personally create the game experience that suits you best, immerse yourself in it, and create hours of wonderful memories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing you an enjoyable experience!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"70aee7e755d055a9ada753aeaff24f331c458fce.jpg","localized_name":"What is It?","name":"What is It?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams